    "https://services.miu.edu/human-resources/faculty/apply/guest-lecturer/": {
      "title": "Guest Lecturer",
      "description": "Guest Lecturer Campus Services Health Security More Dining Hours Accounting Housing Facilities Mail IT Support Subdomains: Home Students Faculty Staff Alumni Services Library Research Giving Trustees Home Students Faculty Staff Alumni Services Library Research Giving Trustees Campus Services Health Security Dining Hours Accounting Housing Facilities Mail IT Support Home Students Faculty Staff Alumni Services Library Research Giving Trustees Campus Services Health Security Dining Hours Accounting Housing Facilities Mail IT Support MIU Health Security Dining Hours Accounting Housing Facilities Mail IT Support More MIU Home Dining Hours Accounting Housing Facilities Mail IT Support > Related Pages Faculty Returning Faculty Overview Hire Steps Apply Overview Information Form Full Time Application Part Time and Visiting Application Guest Lecturer College Salary Report by Payscale MIU alumni median salaries > Financial aid calculator It only takes 10 seconds > Related Pages Faculty Returning Faculty Overview Hire Steps Apply Overview Information Form Full Time Application Part Time and Visiting Application Guest Lecturer Guest Lecturer Thank you for your interest in applying as faculty to Maharishi International University. Please see the Application Checklist below that lists the items needed for your complete application. Please return the completed documents by email, fax, or mail. Email : e:dof@miu.edu Phone/fax : 641-472-1161 Mail Address : Dean of Faculty office Maharishi International University 1000 N 4th Street MR 748 Fairfield, IA 52556 Guest Lecturer Guest Lecturer is defined as an individual who has been invited to join a faculty member teach a course for more than 3 days. If you plan to be a guest speaker for 1 – 3 days then please do not submit the application document below, but rather complete this short online form for Guest Speakers in the Classroom. Online Faculty Application Information Form Curriculum Vitae Two letters of Professional Recommendation — letters from professors, thesis advisers, academic department heads, or others describing your knowledge, expertise, and professional experience in your discipline Governor Recommendation Form to be completed by four TM Teachers who know you National Leader Recommendation — Only for non-U.S. Citizens Spouse Application — Please have your spouse fill out the online Faculty Information Form if they will be joining you while on campus. Privacy Waiver — Only if you have a social security number X Follow MIU REQUEST INFO I am a US citizen or Green Card holder * Yes No *required Text me Select degree level * Bachelor's Master's PhD Ed.D. Certificate Program English as a Second Language Program College background Never attended college Attended college but not graduated Have a bachelor's degree or higher On campus or online? On-campus program Online program Considering both Sending... Send Request > Maharishi International University Facebook YouTube Instagram Today's menu at Annapurna Dining Hall MIU Campus App Download and install on your smartphone Campus Security Call 641-472-1115, or 1115 from any campus phone Campus Directory Phone and email for faculty and staff (641) 472-1110 Phone this number and then any campus extension 1000 North Fourth St. Fairfield, Iowa 52556 Copyright © 2026 MIU.  All rights reserved. Conditions of Use | Consumer Information | Privacy Statement"
